        "id": 1308749
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-25T15:38:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can scenario 1 happen on real hardware?  If so, than this should be exposed by the emulator backend as a high-level function.  For instance `connect_charger()` would be responsible for setting the connector capabilities and status, and then pulse a single interrupt.\n\nI don\u0027t think having the test pulse the interrupt is a good approach for the PDC power management tests.",
      "parentUuid": "281ba04a_e07a158c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 59,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 59,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "6459b98b399edafb51279af9a73d675876961598",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
