      "writtenOn": "2024-01-25T17:42:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay, I added a (connect|disconnect)_charger API.  The general test flow will look like \n```\n/* configure emulated PDC responses */\n\nconnect_charger() /* Moves PDC to connected state and alerts driver of changes to be read */\n\n/* Validate power mgmt is in expected state */\n```",
